{"seq":4,"slug":"lock-free","title":"无锁编程与原子操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/lock-free","wordCount":942,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"无锁编程与原子操作\">无锁编程与原子操作</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>无锁编程用原子操作替代互斥锁，消除上下文切换与死锁风险。理解本篇的关键，是分清两个正交的问题：<strong>原子性</strong>由 <code>compare_exchange</code> 这类操作保证，而<strong>可见性与顺序</strong>由 <code>Ordering</code> 参数决定——两者都不是免费获得的，后者尤其容易写错。</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>原子类型保证单个操作不可分割</strong>，但多个原子操作<strong>组合</strong>起来并不自动构成原子事务，需要用 CAS 循环来构造。</li>\n<li><strong><code>Ordering</code> 表达的是重排约束</strong>：<code>Relaxed</code> 只保证原子性，<code>Acquire</code>/<code>Release</code> 建立配对同步，<code>SeqCst</code> 提供全局一致顺序。</li>\n<li><strong>无锁不等于无等待</strong>：无锁保证系统整体有进展，单个线程仍可能反复重试；更高一级的保证是无等待（每个操作有界步数）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"什么是无锁编程\">什么是无锁编程</h2><p>无锁编程（Lock-Free Programming）通过原子操作实现线程间的数据同步，避免了互斥锁带来的上下文切换和线程阻塞开销。核心工具是 <code>std::sync::atomic</code> 模块中的原子类型。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>编程模型</th>\n<th>同步方式</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>互斥锁</td>\n<td><code>Mutex</code> / <code>RwLock</code></td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>上下文切换、死锁风险</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无锁</td>\n<td>原子操作 + CAS</td>\n<td>高性能、无死锁</td>\n<td>复杂、难以正确实现</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无等待</td>\n<td>原子操作，每次操作有界步数</td>\n<td>最强进度保证</td>\n<td>极其复杂</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"原子类型\">原子类型</h2><p><code>std::sync::atomic</code> 提供了一组原子类型，所有操作在硬件级别保证原子性。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicU64, AtomicBool, Ordering};&#10;use std::sync::Arc;&#10;use std::thread;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let counter = Arc::new(AtomicU64::new(0));&#10;    let mut handles = vec![];&#10;&#10;    for _ in 0..10 {&#10;        let counter = Arc::clone(&amp;counter);&#10;        handles.push(thread::spawn(move || {&#10;            for _ in 0..1000 {&#10;                counter.fetch_add(1, Ordering::Relaxed);&#10;            }&#10;        }));&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    for h in handles {&#10;        h.join().unwrap();&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    println!(&quot;计数: {}&quot;, counter.load(Ordering::Relaxed));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicU64, AtomicBool, Ordering};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::Arc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let counter = Arc::new(AtomicU64::new(0));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut handles = vec![];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for _ in 0..10 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let counter = Arc::clone(&#x26;counter);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handles.push(thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            for _ in 0..1000 {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>                counter.fetch_add(1, Ordering::Relaxed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    for h in handles {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        h.join().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    println!(\"计数: {}\", counter.load(Ordering::Relaxed));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>常用原子类型：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>对应基础类型</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>AtomicBool</code></td>\n<td><code>bool</code></td>\n<td>标志位、开关</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AtomicI32</code> / <code>AtomicU32</code></td>\n<td><code>i32</code> / <code>u32</code></td>\n<td>计数器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AtomicI64</code> / <code>AtomicU64</code></td>\n<td><code>i64</code> / <code>u64</code></td>\n<td>统计指标</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AtomicUsize</code></td>\n<td><code>usize</code></td>\n<td>索引、引用计数</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AtomicPtr&lt;T&gt;</code></td>\n<td><code>*mut T</code></td>\n<td>无锁数据结构中的指针</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"内存排序-memory-ordering\">内存排序（Memory Ordering）</h2><p>内存排序决定了原子操作的可见性保证，是无锁编程中最核心也最容易出错的概念。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;Relaxed&quot;] --&gt;|最弱| B[&quot;Acquire / Release&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt;|较强| C[&quot;AcqRel&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|最强| D[&quot;SeqCst&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"Relaxed\"] --&gt;|最弱| B[\"Acquire / Release\"]\n    B --&gt;|较强| C[\"AcqRel\"]\n    C --&gt;|最强| D[\"SeqCst\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>Ordering</th>\n<th>保证</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Relaxed</code></td>\n<td>仅保证原子性，无顺序保证</td>\n<td>最高</td>\n<td>独立计数器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Acquire</code></td>\n<td>当前线程后续读写不会被重排到此操作之前</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>读锁、消费端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Release</code></td>\n<td>当前线程之前的读写不会被重排到此操作之后</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>写锁、生产端</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>AcqRel</code></td>\n<td>同时具备 Acquire 和 Release 语义</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>CAS 操作</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SeqCst</code></td>\n<td>全局顺序一致</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>需要全局一致性时</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"cas-操作\">CAS 操作</h2><p>Compare-And-Swap（CAS）是无锁编程的基础操作：比较当前值与期望值，相等则替换为新值。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicI32, Ordering};&#10;&#10;fn atomic_max(atom: &amp;AtomicI32, new_val: i32) {&#10;    let mut current = atom.load(Ordering::Relaxed);&#10;    loop {&#10;        if current &gt;= new_val {&#10;            return;&#10;        }&#10;        match atom.compare_exchange_weak(&#10;            current,&#10;            new_val,&#10;            Ordering::AcqRel,&#10;            Ordering::Relaxed,&#10;        ) {&#10;            Ok(_) =&gt; return,&#10;            Err(actual) =&gt; current = actual,&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicI32, Ordering};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn atomic_max(atom: &#x26;AtomicI32, new_val: i32) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let mut current = atom.load(Ordering::Relaxed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    loop {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        if current >= new_val {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            return;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        match atom.compare_exchange_weak(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            current,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            new_val,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Ordering::AcqRel,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Ordering::Relaxed,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        ) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Ok(_) => return,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            Err(actual) => current = actual,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>差异</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>compare_exchange</code></td>\n<td>严格 CAS</td>\n<td>仅在值匹配时成功</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>compare_exchange_weak</code></td>\n<td>可能虚假失败</td>\n<td>在循环中使用，某些架构性能更高</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自旋锁实现\">自旋锁实现</h2><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicBool, Ordering};&#10;use std::cell::UnsafeCell;&#10;&#10;pub struct SpinLock&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    locked: AtomicBool,&#10;    data: UnsafeCell&lt;T&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;unsafe impl&lt;T: Send&gt; Sync for SpinLock&lt;T&gt; {}&#10;unsafe impl&lt;T: Send&gt; Send for SpinLock&lt;T&gt; {}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;T&gt; SpinLock&lt;T&gt; {&#10;    pub fn new(data: T) -&gt; Self {&#10;        SpinLock {&#10;            locked: AtomicBool::new(false),&#10;            data: UnsafeCell::new(data),&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    pub fn lock(&amp;self) -&gt; SpinGuard&lt;T&gt; {&#10;        while self&#10;            .locked&#10;            .compare_exchange_weak(false, true, Ordering::Acquire, Ordering::Relaxed)&#10;            .is_err()&#10;        {&#10;            std::hint::spin_loop();&#10;        }&#10;        SpinGuard { lock: self }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;pub struct SpinGuard&lt;&#39;a, T&gt; {&#10;    lock: &amp;&#39;a SpinLock&lt;T&gt;,&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;T&gt; std::ops::Deref for SpinGuard&lt;&#39;_, T&gt; {&#10;    type Target = T;&#10;    fn deref(&amp;self) -&gt; &amp;T {&#10;        unsafe { &amp;*self.lock.data.get() }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;T&gt; std::ops::DerefMut for SpinGuard&lt;&#39;_, T&gt; {&#10;    fn deref_mut(&amp;mut self) -&gt; &amp;mut T {&#10;        unsafe { &amp;mut *self.lock.data.get() }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;impl&lt;T&gt; Drop for SpinGuard&lt;&#39;_, T&gt; {&#10;    fn drop(&amp;mut self) {&#10;        self.lock.locked.store(false, Ordering::Release);&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicBool, Ordering};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::cell::UnsafeCell;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct SpinLock&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    locked: AtomicBool,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data: UnsafeCell&#x3C;T>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe impl&#x3C;T: Send> Sync for SpinLock&#x3C;T> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>unsafe impl&#x3C;T: Send> Send for SpinLock&#x3C;T> {}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;T> SpinLock&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn new(data: T) -> Self {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SpinLock {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            locked: AtomicBool::new(false),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            data: UnsafeCell::new(data),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    pub fn lock(&#x26;self) -> SpinGuard&#x3C;T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while self</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .locked</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .compare_exchange_weak(false, true, Ordering::Acquire, Ordering::Relaxed)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .is_err()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            std::hint::spin_loop();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        SpinGuard { lock: self }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>pub struct SpinGuard&#x3C;'a, T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    lock: &#x26;'a SpinLock&#x3C;T>,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;T> std::ops::Deref for SpinGuard&#x3C;'_, T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    type Target = T;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn deref(&#x26;self) -> &#x26;T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unsafe { &#x26;*self.lock.data.get() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;T> std::ops::DerefMut for SpinGuard&#x3C;'_, T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn deref_mut(&#x26;mut self) -> &#x26;mut T {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        unsafe { &#x26;mut *self.lock.data.get() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>impl&#x3C;T> Drop for SpinGuard&#x3C;'_, T> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fn drop(&#x26;mut self) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        self.lock.locked.store(false, Ordering::Release);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"无锁标志位模式\">无锁标志位模式</h2><p>使用原子布尔值作为线程间的信号标志是最简单的无锁模式。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"rust\" data-code=\"use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicBool, Ordering};&#10;use std::sync::Arc;&#10;use std::thread;&#10;use std::time::Duration;&#10;&#10;fn main() {&#10;    let running = Arc::new(AtomicBool::new(true));&#10;    let running_clone = Arc::clone(&amp;running);&#10;&#10;    let worker = thread::spawn(move || {&#10;        let mut count = 0u64;&#10;        while running_clone.load(Ordering::Relaxed) {&#10;            count += 1;&#10;            thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(10));&#10;        }&#10;        println!(&quot;工作线程完成，执行 {} 次&quot;, count);&#10;    });&#10;&#10;    thread::sleep(Duration::from_secs(1));&#10;    running.store(false, Ordering::Relaxed);&#10;    worker.join().unwrap();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::atomic::{AtomicBool, Ordering};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::sync::Arc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::thread;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>use std::time::Duration;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>fn main() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let running = Arc::new(AtomicBool::new(true));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let running_clone = Arc::clone(&#x26;running);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    let worker = thread::spawn(move || {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        let mut count = 0u64;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        while running_clone.load(Ordering::Relaxed) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            count += 1;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            thread::sleep(Duration::from_millis(10));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        println!(\"工作线程完成，执行 {} 次\", count);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    thread::sleep(Duration::from_secs(1));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    running.store(false, Ordering::Relaxed);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    worker.join().unwrap();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"选择指南\">选择指南</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>场景</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>原因</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>简单计数器/统计</td>\n<td><code>AtomicU64</code> + <code>Relaxed</code></td>\n<td>无需顺序保证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>线程停止标志</td>\n<td><code>AtomicBool</code> + <code>Relaxed</code></td>\n<td>最终一致即可</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>生产者-消费者标志</td>\n<td><code>Acquire</code> / <code>Release</code></td>\n<td>保证数据在标志之前可见</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通用共享数据</td>\n<td><code>Mutex</code> / <code>RwLock</code></td>\n<td>简单安全，性能足够</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高并发热路径</td>\n<td>无锁数据结构（crossbeam）</td>\n<td>避免锁竞争</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不确定时</td>\n<td><code>SeqCst</code></td>\n<td>最安全，后续可优化</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>无锁编程以原子操作为基础，避免锁带来的上下文切换与死锁风险，代价是实现复杂度显著上升。</li>\n<li><code>Ordering</code> 是无锁编程最关键也最易错的部分：<code>Relaxed</code> 适合独立计数器，<code>Acquire</code>/<code>Release</code> 配对用于生产者-消费者，不确定时用 <code>SeqCst</code>。</li>\n<li>CAS（<code>compare_exchange</code>）是构造无锁结构的基础原语，通常配合循环重试使用。</li>\n<li>无锁只保证系统整体有进展，不等于无等待；复杂场景应优先使用经过验证的 <code>crossbeam</code> 等库。</li>\n<li>多数业务场景下 <code>Mutex</code>/<code>RwLock</code> 已足够，无锁应留给确有竞争热点的路径。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"无锁编程与原子操作","id":"无锁编程与原子操作"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是无锁编程","id":"什么是无锁编程"},{"level":2,"text":"原子类型","id":"原子类型"},{"level":2,"text":"内存排序（Memory Ordering）","id":"内存排序-memory-ordering"},{"level":2,"text":"CAS 操作","id":"cas-操作"},{"level":2,"text":"自旋锁实现","id":"自旋锁实现"},{"level":2,"text":"无锁标志位模式","id":"无锁标志位模式"},{"level":2,"text":"选择指南","id":"选择指南"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"async/await 与异步运行时","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/concurrency/async-await"},"next":{"title":"unsafe Rust 与 FFI","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/rust-language/systems-programming/unsafe-and-ffi"}}